msgstr "Byvoeging van sagtewarebron het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:361
msgid "Enabling component of the distribution failed"
msgstr "Aktivering van komponent van die verspreiding het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:363 aptkit/enums.py:364
msgid "Removing downloaded package files failed"
msgstr "Verwydering van afgelaaide pakketlêers het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:365
msgid "Search failed"
msgstr "Soektog het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:366
msgid "Adding license key"
msgstr "Voeg lisensiesleutel by"

#: aptkit/enums.py:370
msgid "Check your Internet connection."
msgstr "Gaan jou internetkonneksie na"

#: aptkit/enums.py:371
msgid "See the error details below for more information."
msgstr ""

#: aptkit/enums.py:372
msgid ""
"Check if you are using third party repositories. If so disable them, since "
"they are a common source of problems.\n"
"Furthermore run the following command in a Terminal: apt-get install -f"
msgstr ""
"Kontroleer of jy derdeparty sagtwarebronne gebruik. Indien wel, skakel dit "
"uit aangesien dit 'n algemene bron van probleme is.\n"
"Verder hardloop die volgende bevel in 'n terminaal: apt-get install -f"

#: aptkit/enums.py:377
msgid ""
"Check if you are currently running another software management tool, e.g. "
"Synaptic or aptitude. Only one tool is allowed to make changes at a time."
msgstr ""
"Kontroleer of jy tans 'n ander sagtewarebestuursprogram hardloop, bv. "
"Synaptic of aptitude. Slegs een program mag op 'n slag veranderings maak."

#: aptkit/enums.py:380
msgid ""
"This is a serious problem. Try again later. If this problem appears again, "
"please report an error to the developers."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n ernstige probleem. Probeer weer later. As die probleem weer "
"voorkom, rapporteer die fout aan die programmeerders."

#: aptkit/enums.py:383
msgid ""
"Check the spelling of the package name, and that the appropriate repository "
"is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Kontroleer die spelling van die pakketnaam, en dat die toepaslike "
"sagtewarebron geaktiveer is."

#: aptkit/enums.py:385
msgid "There isn't any need for an update."
msgstr "Daar is geen behoefte vir 'n opdatering nie."

#: aptkit/enums.py:386
msgid "There isn't any need for an installation"
msgstr "Daar is geen behoefte vir 'n installasie nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:388
msgid "There isn't any need for a removal."
msgstr "Daar is geen behoefte vir 'n verwydering nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:389
msgid ""
"You requested to remove a package which is an essential part of your system."
msgstr ""
"Jy het versoek dat 'n pakket, wat 'n noodsaaklike deel van jou stelsel is, "
"verwyder word"

#: aptkit/enums.py:392
msgid ""
"The connection to the daemon was lost. Most likely the background daemon "
"crashed."
msgstr ""
"Die konneksie tot die daemoon is gebreek. Heel moontlik omdat die "
"agtergronddaemoon gefaal het."

#: aptkit/enums.py:394
msgid "The installation or removal of a software package failed."
msgstr "Die installasie of verwydering van 'n sagtewarepakket het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:396
msgid "The requested feature is not supported."
msgstr "Die versoekte kenmerk word nie ondersteun nie."

#: aptkit/enums.py:397
msgid ""
"There seems to be a programming error in aptkit, the software that allows "
"you to install/remove software and to perform other package management "
"related tasks."
msgstr ""
"Dit lyk of daar 'n programmeringsfout in aptkit is, die sagteware wat jou "
"toelaat om sagteware te installeer/verwyder en ander pakketbestuurverwante "
"take uit te voer."

#: aptkit/enums.py:401
msgid ""
"This error could be caused by required additional software packages which "
"are missing or not installable. Furthermore there could be a conflict "
"between software packages which are not allowed to be installed at the same "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie fout kan veroorsaak word deur vereiste bykomende sagtewarepakkette "
"wat ontbreek of nie installeerbaar is nie. Verder kan daar 'n konflik wees "
"tussen sagtewarepakkette wat nie terselfdertyd geïnstalleer mag word nie."

#: aptkit/enums.py:407
msgid "This requires installing packages from unauthenticated sources."
msgstr ""
"Dit vereis die installasie van pakkette vanaf ongeverifieerde bronne."

#: aptkit/enums.py:409
msgid ""
"The installation could have failed because of an error in the corresponding "
"software package or it was cancelled in an unfriendly way. You have to "
"repair this before you can install or remove any further software."
msgstr ""
"Die installasie kon misluk het as gevolg van 'n fout in die ooreenstemmende "
"sagtewarepakket, of dit was gekanselleer op 'n ongeldige manier. Jy sal dit "
"moet herstel alvorens jy enige verdere sagteware kan installeer of verwyder."

#: aptkit/enums.py:415
msgid ""
"Please copy the file to your local computer and check the file permissions."
msgstr ""
"Kopieer asseblief die lêer na jou plaaslike rekenaar en kontroleer die "
"lêerregte."

#: aptkit/enums.py:418
msgid ""
"The installation of a package which violates the quality standards isn't "
"allowed. This could cause serious problems on your computer. Please contact "
"the person or organisation who provided this package file and include the "
"details beneath."
msgstr ""
"Die installasie van 'n pakket wat die gehaltestandaarde oortree, word nie "
"toegelaat nie. Dit kan ernstige probleme op jou rekenaar veroorsaak. Kontak "
"asseblief die persoon of organisasie wat hierdie pakketlêer verskaf het en "
"sluit die besonderhede hieronder in."

#: aptkit/enums.py:425
msgid ""
"The downloaded license key which is required to run this piece of software "
"is not valid or could not be installed correctly.\n"
"See the details for more information."
msgstr ""
"Die afgelaaide lisensiesleutel wat nodig is om hierdie sagteware te "
"hardloop, is ongeldig of kon nie korrek geïnstalleer word nie.\n"
"Sien die besonderhede vir meer inligting."

#: aptkit/enums.py:431
msgid "All available upgrades have already been installed."
msgstr "Alle beskikbare opgraderings is reeds geïnstalleer."

#: aptkit/enums.py:433
msgid ""
"The license key which allows you to use this piece of software could not be "
"downloaded. Please check your network connection."
msgstr ""
"Die lisensiesleutel wat jou toelaat om hierdie sagteware te gebruik, kon nie "
"afgelaai word nie. Kontroleer asseblief jou netwerkkonneksie."

#: aptkit/enums.py:437
msgid "You don't have the required privileges to perform this action."
msgstr "Jy het nie die vereiste voorregte om hierdie aksie uit te voer nie."

#: aptkit/enums.py:439
msgid ""
"You either provided a wrong password or cancelled the authorization.\n"
"Furthermore there could also be a technical reason for this error if you "
"haven't seen a password dialog: your desktop environment doesn't provide a "
"PolicyKit session agent."
msgstr ""
"Jy het óf 'n verkeerde wagwoord verskaf óf die magtiging gekanselleer.\n"
"Verder kan daar ook 'n tegniese rede vir hierdie fout wees as jy nie 'n "
"wagwoorddialoog gesien het nie: jou werkskermomgewing bied nie 'n PolicyKit-"
"sessieagent nie."

#: aptkit/enums.py:447
msgid "Failed to download package files"
msgstr "Aflaai van pakketlêers het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:448
msgid "Failed to download repository information"
msgstr "Aflaai van sagtewarebron informasie het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:450
msgid "Package dependencies cannot be resolved"
msgstr "Pakketafhanklikhede kon nie opgelos word nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:451
msgid "The package system is broken"
msgstr "Die pakketstelsel is gebreek"

#: aptkit/enums.py:452
msgid "Failed to lock the package manager"
msgstr "Kon nie die pakketbestuurder sluit nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:453
msgid "Failed to load the package list"
msgstr "Kon nie die pakketlys laai nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:454
msgid "Package does not exist"
msgstr "Pakket bestaan nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:455
msgid "Package is already up to date"
msgstr "Pakket is reeds op datum"

#: aptkit/enums.py:456
msgid "Package is already installed"
msgstr "Pakket is reeds geïnstalleer"

#: aptkit/enums.py:457
msgid "Package isn't installed"
msgstr "Pakket is nie geïnstalleer nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:458
msgid "Failed to remove essential system package"
msgstr "Kon nie die noodsaaklike stelselpakket verwyder nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:460
msgid "Task cannot be monitored or controlled"
msgstr "Taak kan nie gemonitor of uitgevoer word nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:461
msgid "Package operation failed"
msgstr "Pakket operasie het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:462
msgid "Requires installation of untrusted packages"
msgstr "Vereis die installasie van onbetroubare pakkette"

#: aptkit/enums.py:464
msgid "Previous installation hasn't been completed"
msgstr "Vorige installasie is onvoltooid"

#: aptkit/enums.py:465
msgid "The package is of bad quality"
msgstr "Die pakket is van swak gehalte"

#: aptkit/enums.py:466
msgid "Package file could not be opened"
msgstr "Pakketlêer kon nie oopgemaak word nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:467
msgid "Not supported feature"
msgstr "Kenmerk word nie ondersteun nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:468
msgid "Failed to download the license key"
msgstr "Aflaai van die lisensiesleutel het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:469
msgid "Failed to install the license key"
msgstr "Installasie van die lisensiesleutel het misluk"

#: aptkit/enums.py:470
msgid "The system is already up to date"
msgstr "Die stelsel is reeds op datum"

#: aptkit/enums.py:471
msgid "You could not be authorized"
msgstr "Jy kon nie gemagtig word nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:472
msgid "You are not allowed to perform this action"
msgstr "Jy word nie toegelaat om hierdie aksie uit te voer nie"

#: aptkit/enums.py:473
msgid "An unhandlable error occured"
msgstr "'n Onhanteerbare fout het voorgekom"

#: aptkit/enums.py:476
msgid "Waiting for service to start"
msgstr "Wag vir die diens om aan te skakel"

#: aptkit/enums.py:478
msgid "Waiting"
msgstr "Wag tans"

#: aptkit/enums.py:479
msgid "Waiting for required medium"
msgstr "Wag tans op die vereiste medium"

#: aptkit/enums.py:480
msgid "Waiting for other software managers to quit"
msgstr "Wag tans vir die ander sagtewarebestuurders om af te sluit"

#: aptkit/enums.py:481
msgid "Waiting for configuration file prompt"
msgstr "Wag tans op die por vanaf die verstellingslêer"

#: aptkit/enums.py:483
msgid "Running task"
msgstr "Aktiewe taak"

#: aptkit/enums.py:484
msgid "Downloading"
msgstr "Besig om af te laai"

#: aptkit/enums.py:485
msgid "Querying software sources"
msgstr "Raadpleeg sagtewarebronne"

#: aptkit/enums.py:486
msgid "Cleaning up"
msgstr "Opruim"

#: aptkit/enums.py:487
msgid "Resolving dependencies"
msgstr "Los afhanklikhede op"

#: aptkit/enums.py:489
msgid "Finished"
msgstr "Afgehandel"

#: aptkit/enums.py:490
msgid "Cancelling"
msgstr "Kanselleer"

#: aptkit/enums.py:491
msgid "Loading software list"
msgstr "Laai van sagteware lys"

#: aptkit/enums.py:492
msgid "Waiting for authentication"
msgstr "Wag tans op verifiëring"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the name of a package
#: aptkit/enums.py:496
#, python-format
